{"annotations":{"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Analyze a speech recording"},"description":"Analyze a spoken recording: it is transcribed, then returns everything analyze_transcript does plus delivery metrics only audio can give: words per minute, pace, pauses per minute, filler rate, pitch (median and range) and vocal expression, and pacing, pronunciation and engagement scores. Limits: up to 120 seconds and 10 MB; mp3, m4a/mp4, wav, webm, ogg or flac; at least 30 spoken words. Pass audioUrl (public https) or audioBase64. Free: 1 analysis a day per network; a try that fails on our side does not count, up to 3 tries a day. Audio is deleted once the response is sent.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"audioBase64":{"description":"The recording as base64 (a data: URL prefix is fine). Use this or audioUrl.","type":"string"},"audioUrl":{"description":"A public https link to the recording. Use this or audioBase64.","type":"string"},"context":{"description":"What the speech is for, so the feedback is calibrated to it. Defaults to general.","enum":["general","impromptu","presentation","speech","interview","ielts","conversation"],"type":"string"},"mimeType":{"description":"The audio type when it cannot be sniffed from the bytes, e.g. audio/mpeg","type":"string"},"topic":{"description":"The question or prompt being answered, e.g. an IELTS cue card or interview question","maxLength":500,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"analyze_speech","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"callToAction":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"text":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string"}},"required":["text","url"],"type":"object"},"coaching":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"deliveryMoments":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"description":{"type":"string"},"excerpt":{"type":"string"},"label"